发现偏离或违背方案，应由研究者或监查员填写偏离方案记录，详细记录事件发生的时间及过程、原因及相应的处理措施，由研究者签字，并根据研究中心相关规定通报伦理委员会及申办者。所有可能严重违背方案的情况都必须立即报告申办者。当发生重大方案违背时，应由研究者和申办者进行评估；必要时，申办者可以提前终止本研究。","rationale":"方案偏离的识别、记录、通报与评估流程有跨适应症语料支持其监管共性结构。本项目为II期多中心研究，方案依从为必要管理条款。具体偏离分级标准、报告时限及伦理通报路径缺少项目级来源，已列入待确认项。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_87f40e13681c21a4","section_number":"12.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9c850c6514220090fce97a1a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3152bfe8bf762f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f124dc45ec3cd8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"6194e272adf9994f452cdae612aa68b0c37e2613d44227fb1bd058d709fd5f7b","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_83e9420f4f9f88b3:full-draft:9c850c6514220090fce97a1a","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:9c850c6514220090fce97a1a","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:9f14082f8ca9ba3e77613e4c62ca77cff3c65d122f60d56d8ea6c8a1ffab8aa1:9c850c6514220090fce97a1a","text_sha256":"6194e272adf9994f452cdae612aa68b0c37e2613d44227fb1bd058d709fd5f7b"},{"content_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","text_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d"},{"co